title: Nutanix Prism: Cluster Health (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the health score (0-100) of the cluster as calculated by
 Nutanix from the results of its health checks. By default the service goes
 WARN below 70 and CRIT below 50, the levels can be configured with the rule
 "Nutanix Cluster Health".

 The operation mode of the cluster is checked as well: NORMAL is OK,
 READ_ONLY is CRIT and every other mode (e.g. STAND_ALONE, OVERRIDE) is WARN.
 The service is CRIT if the cluster reports that it is not available.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

discovery:
 One service is created for the cluster.
